5715 strings in the 3 edited files, positive control true; CI Test Core runs the file. Control-byte self-scan of the 3 files: grep -naP exit 1 (none). Ablation and reverse verification: not applicable (docs only, no tested behaviour changed). NOT MEASURED: live verification re-run of the three clauses on a booted showcase. Reason: it needs a full workspace build, a v17 SQLite minted from npm @objectstack/cli@17.7.0 and two showcase boots in a container shared with another dev agent, and the dispatch asked for a source re-measurement.",
